title: Laptops
owner: security
review: yearly
effective: 2026-10-10
review-by: 2027-10-10
---

A laptop holds source code, credentials, and sometimes customer data. This policy covers every laptop used for work.

@note {type=policy}
Disks are encrypted, screens lock after five minutes, and a lost laptop is reported within an hour.

## Disk encryption
@id: disk-encryption

Turn on full-disk encryption before you put any work on the laptop, and leave it on.

## Screen lock
@id: screen-lock

Set the screen to lock after five minutes without use, and to ask for your password to unlock.

## A lost or stolen laptop
@id: lost-or-stolen

Report it within an hour of noticing it's gone, at any time of day.

@include: ../_fragments/report.md

